<Slide>
  <Box style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#0B1120', padding: '20px 64px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    {/* A 标题块 */}
    <Box style={{ height: 96, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', borderBottom: '2px solid rgba(59,130,246,0.3)' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#06B6D4', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 2 }}>第 5 章 · PS2 控制</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, color: '#E2E8F0', fontWeight: 'bold', marginTop: 4 }}>PS2 读取流程：从轮询到注入</Text>
    </Box>
    {/* B 内容区：左流程 SVG + 右说明 */}
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, marginTop: 16, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 28 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 520, background: '#0F172A', borderRadius: 10, padding: '10px 12px', display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <svg width='496' height='400' viewBox='0 0 496 400' style={{ display: 'block' }}>
          <defs><marker id='ar3' markerWidth='10' markerHeight='10' refX='8' refY='3' orient='auto'><path d='M0,0 L8,3 L0,6 Z' fill='#64748B' /></marker></defs>
          <rect x='20' y='20' width='220' height='56' rx='8' fill='#1E293B' stroke='#3B82F6' strokeWidth='2' />
          <text x='130' y='54' fill='#E2E8F0' fontSize='15' textAnchor='middle' fontWeight='bold'>app_ps2_run()</text>
          <text x='130' y='92' fill='#94A3B8' fontSize='12' textAnchor='middle'>每 50ms 进一次</text>
          <path d='M130 76 V120' stroke='#64748B' strokeWidth='2' markerEnd='url(#ar3)' />
          <rect x='20' y='120' width='220' height='56' rx='8' fill='#1E293B' stroke='#3B82F6' strokeWidth='2' />
          <text x='130' y='148' fill='#E2E8F0' fontSize='14' textAnchor='middle' fontWeight='bold'>psx_buf[2]==0x5A?</text>
          <text x='130' y='170' fill='#94A3B8' fontSize='12' textAnchor='middle'>就绪才处理</text>
          <path d='M130 176 V210' stroke='#64748B' strokeWidth='2' markerEnd='url(#ar3)' />
          <rect x='20' y='210' width='220' height='56' rx='8' fill='#1E293B' stroke='#3B82F6' strokeWidth='2' />
          <text x='130' y='238' fill='#E2E8F0' fontSize='14' textAnchor='middle' fontWeight='bold'>ps2_write_read()</text>
          <text x='130' y='260' fill='#94A3B8' fontSize='12' textAnchor='middle'>发0x01 0x42 + 7字节</text>
          <path d='M130 266 V300' stroke='#64748B' strokeWidth='2' markerEnd='url(#ar3)' />
          <rect x='20' y='300' width='220' height='56' rx='8' fill='#0B1120' stroke='#06B6D4' strokeWidth='2.5' />
          <text x='130' y='328' fill='#06B6D4' fontSize='14' textAnchor='middle' fontWeight='bold'>ps2_transfer()×9</text>
          <text x='130' y='350' fill='#94A3B8' fontSize='12' textAnchor='middle'>GPIO 模拟 SPI 逐位</text>
          <rect x='290' y='300' width='200' height='56' rx='8' fill='#0B1120' stroke='#FBBF24' strokeWidth='2' />
          <text x='390' y='328' fill='#FBBF24' fontSize='14' textAnchor='middle' fontWeight='bold'>parse_psx_buf()</text>
          <text x='390' y='350' fill='#94A3B8' fontSize='12' textAnchor='middle'>边沿→注入</text>
          <path d='M240 328 H290' stroke='#64748B' strokeWidth='2' markerEnd='url(#ar3)' />
        </svg>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
          <span style={{ color: '#FBBF24', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>app_ps2_run</span> 每 50ms 轮询一次（避免主循环被打满）。先确认 <span style={{ color: '#06B6D4' }}>psx_buf[2]==0x5A</span>（手柄就绪标志），否则直接跳过——防止未连手柄时误触发。
        </Text>
        <Box style={{ background: 'rgba(59,130,246,0.08)', borderRadius: 8, padding: '12px 16px' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#CBD5E1', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
            <span style={{ color: '#3B82F6', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>ps2_write_read</span>：拉低 CS，依次发 <span style={{ color: '#06B6D4' }}>0x01 0x42</span> 再收 7 字节，凑成 9 字节一帧（含模式字节与 16 个按键位）。
          </Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ background: 'rgba(6,182,212,0.08)', borderRadius: 8, padding: '12px 16px' }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#CBD5E1', lineHeight: '1.5' }}>
            <span style={{ color: '#06B6D4', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>ps2_transfer</span>：用 GPIO 翻转 CMD/CLK + 读 DAT，逐位(MSB)收发——即「软件模拟 SPI」，因为 STM32 硬件 SPI 时序不匹配手柄。
          </Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: '1.6' }}>
          仅当本次按键状态与上次的缓存不同，才进入 parse_psx_buf——无变化不重复处理。
        </Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
    {/* C 页脚 */}
    <Box style={{ height: 40, display: 'flex', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8' }}>六轴机械臂代码详解</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8' }}>36 / 41</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
</Slide>
